{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Extend Working Time Regulations to contracted freelance workers",
        "additional_details": "Many industries engage freelancers for lengthy contracts of 50+ hours per week, exceeding the working time limits which standard employees have the right to. I propose that the Working Time Regulations regarding maximum weekly working time and daily/weekly rest become a statutory right for freelancers who are engaged by a company, in keeping with the need to protect the health and safety of workers. Optionally, employers may offer an opt-out for freelancers who want to work in excess of 48 hours/week as overtime. ",
        "background": "Mandate that freelance contracts must abide by the following Working Time Regulations:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Maximum of 48 hours/week\r\n\u2022 Right to rest",
